The browser client in apps/web is derived from open_spiel/gui. The Python
server in apps/server is derived from open_spiel/python/gui. The engine
adapter in packages/python/engine is derived from
open_spiel/python/games/pokerkit_wrapper.py and its tests.

Modifications include the standalone package layout, poker-only application,
structured private observations, remote-bot observation transport, PokerKit
table presentation, and bot-only launcher. Original copyright and license
notices are retained in the copied files. Modified files carry a notice.

PokerKit and OpenSpiel are installed as dependencies. Their distribution
licenses and notices remain with those packages. Browser dependency notices
are retained under apps/web/licenses and included in the client build.
